FEATURE: prompt-module
DATE: 2026-11-09
SCOPE: new Prompt module (Promise-based alert/confirm/input dialogs) and its first consumer

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
AFFECTED PROJECTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

vUX: additive, a new module plus one line in the module registry. Consumers that do
not import vUX-prompt.js are unaffected.

app.myinvitees.com: card-ops.js uses Prompt for its two delete confirmations
(unpaid order, generated cards) instead of window.confirm().

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WHAT CHANGED
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

new Prompt(); config (theme, okText, cancelText, width, speed, closeOnBackdrop,
respectReducedMotion); initialize(); alert/confirm/input(message, options) return
Promises resolving undefined / boolean / string-or-null. Options: title, danger and
the config keys; input adds value, placeholder, inputType, maxLength, required,
validate (sync or async). closeAll(), destroy(), pending.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
VERIFICATION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Headless Chromium (playwright-core, chrome-headless-shell 1228):
  - confirm with danger: focus on Cancel, body overflow hidden; OK -> true; dialog
    removed, focus back on the opener, overflow restored
  - queue: two calls, pending 2; Escape -> false, second opens; Enter -> undefined
  - input: required + validate refuses "ab" with its message, accepts "abc"
  - closeOnBackdrop: click outside -> false
  - destroy() with one open and one queued: resolves null and false, no dialogs left
  - validation errors thrown with their messages
  - example page at 1280 and 390: no horizontal scroll, no console errors; async
    validate disables OK while running and shows the refusal
card-ops.js: the edited file parses; not exercised in the running app.

dist/ (minified build) was not regenerated; run ./minify.sh to refresh it.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
VALIDATOR FOLLOW-UP (features-validator: PASS WITH FINDINGS, fixes applied)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  - Page freeze: Prompt no longer freezes a body that is already overflow:hidden
    (a ModalDisplayer layer holds it), so a panel closed while a prompt is up can
    no longer leave the page locked. Verified: panel closed under an open prompt,
    overflow "" during and after.
  - A dialog closed (close()) or removed by other code resolves as cancelled and
    the queue moves on. Verified: both cases, next queued dialog opens, pending 0.
  - options === null throws the module's own TypeError; config.width "0px" is refused.
  - doc: an element message is moved into the dialog, pass a fresh node.
  - card-ops.js: ask.closeAll() on route entry, next to panelModal/notice.closeAll().
